{"id":"f1bc6feca0af5d29","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-regular-value.md","title":"Regular Value","display":"df-regular-value — Regular Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-regular-value","aliases":["58-df-regular-value","Regular Value"],"display":"df-regular-value — Regular Value","depends_on":["[[58-df-smooth-map]]","[[58-df-regular-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-regular-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-regular-value</span><span>Regular Value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-value — Regular Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"58-df-smooth-map\">58-df-smooth-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e5a25c93496ad88\" href=\"?note=4e5a25c93496ad88\" title=\"58-df-regular-point\">58-df-regular-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:M\\to N\">\\(f:M\\to N\\)</span> (smooth map between manifolds)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in N\">\\(y\\in N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\)</span> (smooth-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"58-df-smooth-map\">58-df-smooth-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RegularValue}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RegularValue}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\\)</span> (regular-point predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e5a25c93496ad88\" href=\"?note=4e5a25c93496ad88\" title=\"58-df-regular-point\">58-df-regular-point</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{RegularValue}_S(y,f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land y\\in N\\land\\forall p\\in f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]\\;\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{RegularValue}_S(y,f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land y\\in N\\land\\forall p\\in f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]\\;\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The condition is vacuously true when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]=\\emptyset\">\\(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]=\\emptyset\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The regular-value preimage theorem and Sard's theorem require additional differentiability and manifold hypotheses and are theorem-level consequences.</li>\n<li>For a regular value, a nonempty fiber has codimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim N\">\\(\\dim N\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n<li>Hirsch, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-smooth-map","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-point","status":"resolved","id":"4e5a25c93496ad88","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-map","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)$ (smooth-map predicate, see [[58-df-smooth-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-point","status":"resolved","id":"4e5a25c93496ad88","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)$ (regular-point predicate, see [[58-df-regular-point]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:M\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RegularValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{RegularValue}_S(y,f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land y\\in N\\land\\forall p\\in f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]\\;\\mathrm{RegularPoint}_S(p,f,M,N)","display":true},{"tex":"f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim N","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1065","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-regular-value.md|58-df-regular-value]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["d87c5d842ade903d","4e5a25c93496ad88"]}